    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This paper discusses the background of the Transgender Cultural District and the context surrounding the transgender community in the Tenderloin. It then summarizes the work that I performed during my ten weeks working at the Transgender Cultural District. It also includes a critical reflection of my experience at the non-profit organization, and what knowledge I took from it.",
